te":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T05:05:02-07:00","id":1208804,"title":"","content":"It took 5-6 month for Changeling 20th from the backer PDF to have it available for everyone, and the deluxe edition are being delivered now (so about 1 year after backer PDF), Wraith 20th should be available in a few months!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5462-kendaan","name":"Kendaan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"150"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-14T01:08:11-07:00","id":1227384,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kendaan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/1208282-what-s-taking-so-long-for-wraith-20th?p=1208804#post1208804\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It took 5-6 month for Changeling 20th from the backer PDF to have it available for everyone, and the deluxe edition are being delivered now (so about 1 year after backer PDF), Wraith 20th should be available in a few months!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Which really is crazy, seeing as how I have had my Changeling: 20 sitting on my bookshelf up there next to my Mage:20 - Vampire:20 - Werewolf: 20 for nearly a year; and Wraith: 20's Kickstarter ended a year earlier.<br /> <br /> Does anybody else remember how long this project hovered around in art direction?<br /> <br /> However, we <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><i>are</i></span> closer to a release, so they tell us ...<br /> <br /> .<br /> .<br /> .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6040-quiet-storm","name":"Quiet Storm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6040_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-18T07:06:57-07:00","id":1228278,"title":"","content":"Wraith and Geist have nothing to do with each other in terms of their development schedules, so no, one did not hold up the other.<br /> <br /> Wraith went through a long writing and development process (writers dropped at the past minute, the developer suffered many misfortunes) but the PDF went out to backers. <br /> <br /> We then assembled errata and I spent a good while incorporating it. It's not as easy as just deleting and replacing words when you have to ensure everything still fits in the page, including art. We added the absent Lifesight, Deathsight, and more missing things at that stage.<br /> <br /> Errata incorporated, I then sent the book on the Indexer. It takes a while to index a book this size but I'm informed work is proceeding apace. As soon as that's done and I'm happy with the index, the amended PDF will go out to backers, non-backers will be able to buy the PDF, and we'll order test runs of the print copy.<br /> <br /> Once we're happy with the print copy (it does take time to ensure all the pages are aligned, there's no art bleed, etc.) we'll be able to put it on sale as print on demand and put our order in for completion of the deluxe copies.<br /> <br /> So that's where we are <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-27T09:19:02-07:00","id":1239331,"title":"","content":"Just got my updated backer pdf!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/memb